# cards: the dragons' and Caucus's new gear effects (docs/plan-cards.md 8, point 5). Jian wears the Red Dragon card
# (262, his slot 0x020B46A2) and Lucia the Caucus card (258, her slot 0x020B46FE); first temple battle, the enemies
# attack. func_0206ab6c totals a member's gear into 0x0213B908: expect the fire byte (+0x0E, 0x0213B916) at 50 when it
# is Jian's (the game's 100 less 50) and the HP regen byte (+0x08, 0x0213B910) at 3 when it is Lucia's. Run with --save.
include party2_strong
poke u32 0x020B0F00 0
poke u8 0x0213ba35 1
poke u8 0x0213ba31 1
poke u16 0x020b46a2 262
poke u16 0x020b46fe 258
execpoke 0x01FFD774 u32 0x020B0F00 1
wait 270
watch u32 0x020B0F00 element_path
watch u8 0x0213B916 fire
watch u8 0x0213B910 regen
watch u8 0x0213B913 water
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
press A 8
wait 60
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 3000
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 60
